tfig - terminal figures
=======================

Read pairs of numbers from stdin and draw a scatter plot on the terminal.
Omitted bounds fit the data. Given bounds are inclusive. -s takes one
character. -w and -h must be between 1 and 10000.

Usage Example
-------------

$ seq 1 5 | awk '{print $1, $1*$1}' | tfig -x 0 -X 5 -y 0 -Y 5 -h 5 -w 5 -s '?'

Expected Output
---------------

|  ?  
|     
|     
| ?   
|     
+-----
